docs {
  # List Group Attachments

  **Method:** `GET`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/attachments/group/:group_id`
  **Auth:** None (Public)

  ## Description

  Retrieves paginated attachments associated with a specific group (such as gallery images, videos, and group cover).

  ## Request

  ### URL Parameters

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `group_id` | `int64` | Yes | Target group ID |

  ### Query Parameters

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `page` | `int` | No | Page number (default: 1) |
  | `page_size` | `int` | No | Items per page (default: 20) |
  | `type` | `string` | No | Filter by attachment type (e.g. `GALLERY_IMAGE`, `GALLERY_VIDEO`, `GROUP_COVER`) |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "items": [
        {
          "id": 10,
          "uploaded_by_user_id": 1,
          "uploaded_by_user": {
            "id": 1,
            "name": "Jane Doe"
          },
          "group_id": 1,
          "group": {
            "id": 1,
            "title": "Weekend Trip"
          },
          "type": "GALLERY_IMAGE",
          "original_filename": "mountain.jpg",
          "object_key": "attachments/gallery_image/2026/11/mountain.jpg",
          "access_url": "http://127.0.0.1:9000/doratou-storage/attachments/gallery_image/2026/11/mountain.jpg?...",
          "is_public": false,
          "created_at": "2026-11-09T17:00:00Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-11-09T17:00:00Z"
        }
      ],
      "total_count": 1,
      "page": 1,
      "page_size": 20,
      "total_pages": 1
    }
  }
  ```
}
